"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T17:34:07-08:00","id":1034960,"title":"","content":"My main bugbear from both the SAS and novel material is this tendency to assume a Mummy being killed means that Mummy is gone in something approximating a permanent fashion. It's honestly kinda weird given how big of a deal the Death Cycle is in Mummy.<br /> <br /> But yeah, the Avarice Chronicle also has awesome things like the imagery of Chthonic Beings chained as guard dogs alongside a phalanx of ghost soldiers, so I can look past that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T20:08:01-08:00","id":1035025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Azahul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1034655-mummy-the-curse-resources?p=1034949#post1034949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even the SAS stories proved a source for ideas, even if I didn't use them directly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I really wanted to make use of the intelligent lion-amkhat with the seba heart. My campaign didn't really have room for it, though.<br /> <br /> <div clas